### Notifications — template base
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@accessToken =
@notificationId =

### Minhas notificações
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications?page=1&limit=20&isRead=false
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Contagem não lidas
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Exportar JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/export?format=json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Marcar todas como lidas
PUT {{baseUrl}}/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Limpar todas
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/notifications/clear-all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Limpar apenas lidas
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/notifications/clear-read
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Marcar uma como lida
PUT {{baseUrl}}/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Deletar uma notificação
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/notifications/{{notificationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
